"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":-0.0018,"r5":0.0348,"r1_spy":0.0423,"r5_spy":0.044}}],"quotes":[{"c":"SKT 2018 Q3","e":"skt","d":"2018-11-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas McDonough","x":"This leasing volume was slightly offset by 17,000 square feet of space that was vacated during the quarter, bringing our year-to-date recapture related to bankruptcies and brandwide restructuring to approximately 123,000 square feet.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/02/tanger-factory-outlet-centers-inc-skt-q3-2018-earn.aspx"},{"c":"SKT 2018 Q3","e":"skt","d":"2018-11-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steven Tanger","x":"We have some tenants doing so well that they continue to look to expand their footprint and we have some tenants that are still viable exciting brands, but they've decided to narrow the presentation or take out certain categories and product and they would like to rightsize their store.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/02/tanger-factory-outlet-centers-inc-skt-q3-2018-earn.aspx"},{"c":"SKT 2018 Q4","e":"skt","d":"2019-02-14","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Steven Tanger","x":"And expect if we continue to fill the space with new exciting tenants, that will create more demand and that will lead to more pricing power.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/15/tanger-factory-outlet-centers-skt-q4-2018-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"SKT 2018 Q4","e":"skt","d":"2019-02-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom McDonough","x":"However, we are likely to be impacted and face ongoing pressure from future bankruptcies and restructuring, along with selective lease adjustment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/15/tanger-factory-outlet-centers-skt-q4-2018-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"SKT 2018 Q4","e":"skt","d":"2019-02-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Craig Schmidt","x":"And then on the 9.9% cost of occupancy, given your thought of where sales are heading and where you might be doing some restructuring of leases, do you expect that cost of occupancy to come up or go down?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/15/tanger-factory-outlet-centers-skt-q4-2018-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"SKT 2019 Q2","e":"skt","d":"2019-08-01","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Steven B. Tanger","x":"An interesting concept that we will be testing in our Riverhead, New York center is a new popup store, which will offer consumers the opportunity to interact with digitally native, direct-to-consumer, and licensed brands.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/tanger-factory-outlet-centers-inc-skt-q2-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"SKT 2019 Q2","e":"skt","d":"2019-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James F. Williams","x":"Our outlook for the second half of the year remains unchanged until we get more clarity on unknown bankruptcies or corporate restructuring by tenants on our watch list and variable rents for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/tanger-factory-outlet-centers-inc-skt-q2-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"SKT 2019 Q2","e":"skt","d":"2019-08-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Steven B. Tanger","x":"Based upon stronger than expected year to date results, we are raising our annual guidance for same center NOI, occupancy, and AFFO.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/tanger-factory-outlet-centers-inc-skt-q2-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"SKT 2019 Q2","e":"skt","d":"2019-08-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"James F. Williams","x":"In terms of our outlook for 2019, we are pleased to raise our guidance for the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/tanger-factory-outlet-centers-inc-skt-q2-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"SKT 2019 Q3","e":"skt","d":"2019-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steven B. Tanger","x":"Through the end of the third quarter, we recaptured approximately 195,000 square feet within the consolidated portfolio related to bankruptcies and brandwide restructuring by retailers, including 6000 square feet in the third quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/07/tanger-factory-outlet-centers-inc-skt-q3-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"SKT 2019 Q3","e":"skt","d":"2019-10-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Steven B. Tanger","x":"Based upon our results so far, and our expectations for the remainder of the year, we are raising our guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/07/tanger-factory-outlet-centers-inc-skt-q3-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"SKT 2019 Q3","e":"skt","d":"2019-10-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Steven B. Tanger","x":"We are delighted that we've been able to continue to exceed expectations with regard to our NOI, same-center NOI, and we've increased our guidance for the fourth quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/07/tanger-factory-outlet-centers-inc-skt-q3-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"SKT 2020 Q1","e":"skt","d":"2020-05-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steven B. Tanger","x":"As we mentioned, Tanger never furloughed, never laid off a single employee.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/13/tanger-factory-outlet-centers-inc-skt-q1-2020-earn.aspx"},{"c":"SKT 2020 Q2","e":"skt","d":"2020-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stephen J. Yalof","x":"Year-to-date, 14 retailers on our tenant roster have declared bankruptcy or announced a brandwide restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/06/tanger-factory-outlet-centers-inc-skt-q2-2020-earn.aspx"},{"c":"SKT 2020 Q2","e":"skt","d":"2020-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stephen J. Yalof","x":"And G-III Apparel has announced a brandwide restructuring, including its intention to close all of its Wilson and Bass stores.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/06/tanger-factory-outlet-centers-inc-skt-q2-2020-earn.aspx"},{"c":"SKT 2020 Q3","e":"skt","d":"2020-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stephen J. Yalof","x":"So in that number is both bankruptcy and also restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/06/tanger-factory-outlet-centers-inc-skt-q3-2020-earn/"},{"c":"SKT 2020 Q4","e":"skt","d":"2021-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stephen J. Yalof","x":"Well, look, obviously coming out of 2020, unprecedented returns of space coming back our way through corporate wide restructuring and bankruptcies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/tanger-factory-outlet-centers-inc-skt-q4-2020-earn/"},{"c":"SKT 2020 Q4","e":"skt","d":"2021-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stephen J. Yalof","x":"A lot of that has to do with the fact that vacancy that we received in 2020 and some of the deals that we work with some of the tenants that we're restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/tanger-factory-outlet-centers-inc-skt-q4-2020-earn/"},{"c":"SKT 2021 Q1","e":"skt","d":"2021-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stephen J. Yalof","x":"In 2021, we will continue our efforts to streamline ESG reporting so that the data is more accessible to stakeholders and easier to navigate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/06/tanger-factory-outlet-centers-inc-skt-q1-2021-earn/"},{"c":"SKT 2021 Q1","e":"skt","d":"2021-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James F. Williams","x":"Core FFO for the first quarter of 2021 excludes general and administrative expense of $2.4 million, or $0.02 per share for compensation costs related to a voluntary retirement plan and other executive severance costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/06/tanger-factory-outlet-centers-inc-skt-q1-2021-earn/"},{"c":"SKT 2021 Q2","e":"skt","d":"2021-08-04","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Stephen J. Yalof","x":"These are brands that are iconic, great draws to our shopping center, new uses in both the direct-to-consumer space, going with grocery uses in some of our shopping centers, which in fact we're seeing great results from a traffic drop point of view, but also with the frequency of customer,…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/tanger-factory-outlet-centers-inc-skt-q2-2021-earn/"},{"c":"SKT 2021 Q2","e":"skt","d":"2021-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James F. Williams","x":"Our guidance includes the 135,000 square feet of space we have recaptured-to-date through the end of July, along with potential for an additional 65,000 square feet related to bankruptcies and brandwide restructuring for the remainder of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/tanger-factory-outlet-centers-inc-skt-q2-2021-earn/"},{"c":"SKT 2021 Q2","e":"skt","d":"2021-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stephen J. Yalof","x":"We empowered our general managers and really -- essentially deputized 36 new members of our leasing team to go out and help us fill space in shopping centers that was -- vacancy that was created by brandwide restructuring and other bankruptcies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/tanger-factory-outlet-centers-inc-skt-q2-2021-earn/"},{"c":"SKT 2021 Q3","e":"skt","d":"2021-11-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stephen J. Yalof","x":"Well, first of all, yeah, our variable rent numbers have been great, and as we mentioned, particularly with regard to about a year ago when we were restructuring our deals where we traded some of our base for variable.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/02/tanger-factory-outlet-centers-inc-skt-q3-2021-earn/"},{"c":"SKT 2021 Q3","e":"skt","d":"2021-11-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Mueller","x":"But if you're thinking about the out of the ordinary short term -- shorter term heavier percentage rent deals of restructuring COVID, if you would adjust the spreads for that, how different would the numbers have been compared to the reported numbers?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/02/tanger-factory-outlet-centers-inc-skt-q3-2021-earn/"},{"c":"SKT 2021 Q3","e":"skt","d":"2021-11-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Stephen J. Yalof","x":"We delivered strong performance in the third quarter and the continued momentum we are demonstrating across our portfolio supports our decision to increase our guidance for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/02/tanger-factory-outlet-centers-inc-skt-q3-2021-earn/"},{"c":"SKT 2025 Q4","e":"skt","d":"2026-02-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Andrew Reale","x":"First, if there has been anything on tariffs, just given some very recent headlines.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/25/tanger-skt-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SKT 2025 Q4","e":"skt","d":"2026-02-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Stephen J. Yalof","x":"I think when tariffs were announced in April of last year, I think a lot of retailers were strategic.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/25/tanger-skt-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SKT 2026 Q2","e":"skt","d":"2026-08-05","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Stephen Yalof","x":"The 3 movies that are out currently right now largest box office ever.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/tanger-skt-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SKT 2026 Q2","e":"skt","d":"2026-08-05","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Stephen Yalof","x":"We're seeing extended hours in a lot of the movie theaters.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/tanger-skt-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SKT 2026 Q2","e":"skt","d":"2026-08-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management",